@startuml
title Authentication & Authorized Request Flow

actor User
participant "Client App" as Client
participant "Auth0" as Auth0
participant "Spring Security\nFilter" as Security
participant "JwtToUserAuth\nConverter" as Converter
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepo
participant "Controller" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Authentication ==
User -> Client: Login
Client -> Auth0: POST /oauth/token\n(credentials)
Auth0 --> Client: JWT (access_token)

== Authorized API Request ==
User -> Client: Perform action
Client -> Security: HTTP Request\n+ Bearer JWT
Security -> Auth0: Fetch JWK Set\n(first request only)
Auth0 --> Security: Public keys
Security -> Security: Validate signature,\nissuer & audience
Security -> Converter: Convert JWT to Authentication
Converter -> UserRepo: findBySub(sub)
alt User found
    UserRepo --> Converter: User
else First login — fallback to email
    Converter -> UserRepo: findByEmail(email)
    UserRepo --> Converter: User
    Converter -> UserRepo: save(user with sub)
end
Converter --> Security: UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken
Security -> API: Forward authenticated request
API -> DB: Query / Update
DB --> API: Result
API --> Client: HTTP Response
Client --> User: Display result

@enduml